  "prefLabel": "Alc 103.03 Chairperson; Liaison to the Board of Mental Health Practice",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Alc 103.03 Chairperson; Liaison to the Board of Mental Health Practice.\n\n(a) The board shall elect a chairperson from its membership on an annual basis.\n\n(b) One board member shall be designated to be liaison to the board of mental health practice.\n\nSource. #8169, eff 9-21-04; ss by 9417, eff 3-14-09; ss by #14585, eff 6-1-26",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/alc100-500.html"
